OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court after two die in
OL,4,Apolice pursuit crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith causing the deaths of two people
OL,8,Fby dangerous driving after a crash in
OL,9,FLeeds.
OL,11,FCameron Bell, 22, and 23-year-old Jade
OL,12,FLangton were killed in the collision in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of Sunday.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police said officers had
OL,16,Fbeen following a blue BMW 123D when it
OL,17,Ffailed to stop and crashed into a white
OL,18,FVolkswagen Scirocco at the junction of
OL,19,FGelderd Road and Lowfields Road at
OL,20,F00:44 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
