OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court after two die in
OL,4,Apolice pursuit crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeigh Ross, 39, from Harrogate,
OL,7,Fappeared on Monday at Leeds
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court, where he was
OL,9,Fremanded in custody to appear at Leeds
OL,10,FCrown Court on 17 December. No pleas
OL,11,Fwere entered during the short hearing.
